  "description": "A compensable pipeline for .NET, built on TPL Dataflow: thread a model through ordered steps, auto-compensating completed steps in reverse order on failure. Every step shares the same model-and-cancellation-token contract, so the resulting code is much more readable and the business flow is easier to follow at a glance.",
